    "text": "MaxPreps\nwebsite\nShawano\nVolleyball Recap: Shawano Community Comes Up Short\nBy Team Reports,\n15 hours agoFans were treated to a battle of the Hawks on Tuesday. Shawano Community lost 3-0 to Xavier. Shawano Community's defeat continues a trend for the team, making it six in a row. While Shawano Community was kept off the board, it wasn't for a lack of trying: they cut into Xavier's winning margin in every set. Once all was said and done, the final score wound up at 25-9, 25-14, 25-15.",
